","place_name_jianti_auto":"同州","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"8c224d3a-db0e-11ef-bf24-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":134,"tongjian_id":"8c224d3b-db0e-11ef-904b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河西","place_name_jianti_auto":"河西","start_index":135,"tongjian_id":"8c224d3c-db0e-11ef-b980-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爲，于僞翻。史記：秦厲共公卒，子躁公立。躁公卒，立其弟懷公。四年，庶長鼂圍懷公，公自殺，乃立靈公。靈公卒，子獻公不得立，立靈公之季父，是爲簡公。公卒而惠公立。惠公卒，子出子立。二年，庶長改殺出子，迎立獻公于河西。河西地，卽魏所有西河之外。史記正義曰：自華州北至同州，並魏河西之地。躁，則到翻。共，讀曰恭。鼂，古朝字。長，知兩翻。華，戶化翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"为，于伪翻。史记：秦厉共公卒，子躁公立。躁公卒，立其弟怀公。四年，庶长鼌围怀公，公自杀，乃立灵公。灵公卒，子献公不得立，立灵公之季父，是为简公。公卒而惠公立。惠公卒，子出子立。二年，庶长改杀出子，迎立献公于河西。河西地，即魏所有西河之外。史记正义曰：自华州北至同州，并魏河西之地。躁，则到翻。共，读曰恭。鼌，古朝字。长，知两翻。华，户化翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"8c205180-db0e-11ef-b42b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"秦獻公","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦献公","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c224d40-db0e-11ef-a829-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"徐廣","people_name_jianti_auto":"徐广","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8c224d41-db0e-11ef-894e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8c224d42-db0e-11ef-8fad-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"漢高祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"汉高祖","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8c224d43-db0e-11ef-a925-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太上皇","people_name_jianti_auto":"太上皇","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"8c224d44-db0e-11ef-bcd3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周明帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"周明帝","start_index":137,"tongjian_id":"8c224d45-db0e-11ef-8003-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"櫟陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"栎阳","place_note":"陝西臨潼","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c224d46-db0e-11ef-8b08-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":20,"to